'''El Capitán''' ({{Literal translation|the captain}}) is a [[Cantons of Balisca|borough]] of the [[Castejón|Metropolitan City of Castejón]]. It is the northernmost borough geographically, and is bordered by the boroughs of [[Sástago]] (southwest) and [[Alquézar]] (southeast). 

